  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil and cook the pasta according to package instructions until al dente.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat and sauté the garlic until fragrant, about 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the smoked paprika to the skillet and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Remove the skillet from the heat and stir in the lemon juice, egg, and grated Parmesan until well combined.",
    "Drain the cooked pasta and add it to the skillet, tossing to coat with the smoked paprika emulsion.",
    "Season the pasta with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the pasta immediately, garnished with chopped fresh parsley."
